<title>USA: Aura knows no reason for stock activity.</title>
<headline>Aura knows no reason for stock activity.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aura Systems Inc said it has not made any announcement recently nor does it know of any developments which it believes would account for the unusual trading volume in its common stock over the past few days.&quot;</p>
<p>Aura shares were up 3/32 to 2-7/16 in morning trade Thursday, on volume of about 258,000 shares.</p>
<p>Aura Systems makes electromagnetic devices.</p>
